-- הסכם קיבוצי מיום 24.2.2008 (הסתדרות המורים) — יישום שלב א' ברפורמה
-- במערכת החינוך: תיקון לעניין היקף העבודה הפרטנית. The same parties amend
-- §3 of their agreement of 10.1.2008: in place of §3(ב) comes a new (ב),
-- whose full measure of individual work is for a position of 90% or more
-- (not 75%), with a new row for 75%–89% (§1(א)); in force from 1.2.08
-- (§1(ב)).
--
-- AN AMENDMENT ENCODES WHAT IT CHANGES AND IMPORTS THE REST: the agreement
-- of 10.1.2008
-- (l4/agreements/teachers-general/2008-01-10_pre-ofek_stage-a-individual-hour-supplement.l4)
-- is imported — its steps, its rates, whom it covers and the record of
-- the individual hours a step asks — and only the table of (ב) is defined
-- here, dated, beside the one it replaces.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `2008-01-10_pre-ofek_stage-a-individual-hour-supplement`

-- not weighed against `the Hours of Work and Rest Law`: the position
-- (90%) and the part-time rows set how many individual hours inside the
-- teacher's position the supplement asks; they set no working day, week
-- or overtime.

§ `הסכם קיבוצי — יישום שלב א' ברפורמה במערכת החינוך: תיקון לעניין היקף העבודה הפרטנית (הסתדרות המורים, 24.2.2008)`

-- akn:preamble The agreement's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p1 The document's title; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p3 A date stamp (15.6.200-, its last digit illegible); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p4 The first party, the State, and who represents it (the wages commissioner and the Ministry's Director-General); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p5 The State's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p6 "On the one side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p7 The second party, הסתדרות המורים, and its secretary-general; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p8 The union's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p9 "On the other side"; no rule.

-- ¶2: the day of signing, its day written in by hand.
@ref akn:preamble/p2
`the agreement of 24.2.2008 was signed on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 24 2 2008

#ASSERT DATE_SERIAL `the agreement of 10.1.2008 was signed on` LESS THAN DATE_SERIAL `the agreement of 24.2.2008 was signed on`

§§ `1 יישום שלב א' ברפורמה במערכת החינוך - תיקון`

-- (א): in place of §3(ב) of the agreement of 10.1.2008, a new (ב): (א) is
-- about a teacher at a position of 90% or more; at a smaller position,
-- fewer individual hours, by the table — from 1.1.08 and from 1.1.09:
-- 75%–89%, three hours a month and six hours a month; 50%–74%, two hours
-- a month and one hour a week; 25%–49%, one hour a month and two hours a
-- month. The rows meet at 90%, 75%, 50% and 25%, and a position between
-- two printed figures (89.5%) is in the row below the next one's opening
-- (conventions thresholds.loose and thresholds.shared-bound). Under 25%
-- the new table, as the old, prints no row (convention
-- thresholds.missing-row; finding F-hh-stage-a-a, in the agreement of
-- 10.1.2008).
@ref akn:art_1 akn:art_1__para_a
GIVEN step IS A NUMBER, share IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE `Histadrut stage A individual hours`
DECIDE `the individual hours (ב) of 24.2.2008 asks` step share IS
    BRANCH IF step EQUALS 0 THEN NOTHING
           IF share `has reached the row from` 0.9 THEN JUST (`stage A individual hours of` step TRUE)
           IF share `is in the row from` 0.75 `to` 0.9 THEN JUST (`stage A individual hours of` (3 TIMES step) FALSE)
           IF share `is in the row from` 0.5 `to` 0.75 AND step EQUALS 1 THEN JUST (`stage A individual hours of` 2 FALSE)
           IF share `is in the row from` 0.5 `to` 0.75 THEN JUST (`stage A individual hours of` 1 TRUE)
           IF share `is in the row from` 0.25 `to` 0.5 THEN JUST (`stage A individual hours of` step FALSE)
           OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- (ב): the amendment is in force from 1.2.08 (convention dates.start):
-- before it, §3(ב) as signed on 10.1.2008 (imported) still speaks.
@ref akn:art_1__para_b
`the amendment of 24.2.2008 is in force from` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 2 2008

GIVEN share IS A NUMBER, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE `Histadrut stage A individual hours`
DECIDE `the individual hours stage A asks, as amended on 24.2.2008` share d IS
    IF d `is on or after` `the amendment of 24.2.2008 is in force from`
    THEN `the individual hours (ב) of 24.2.2008 asks` (`the step of the agreement of 10.1.2008 on` d) share
    ELSE `the individual hours stage A asks, as signed on 10.1.2008` share d

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:conclusions/p1 The signing formula; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p2 The signatures; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/t1 The parties signing; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p3 The file number (שכ. 2008-542); no rule.

§§ `examples`

-- At 80%: one weekly hour in January 2008, as signed (75% or more);
-- three hours a month from February, and six a month from 1.1.09.
#ASSERT `the individual hours stage A asks, as amended on 24.2.2008` 0.8 (DATE_FROM_DMY 15 1 2008) EQUALS JUST (`stage A individual hours of` 1 TRUE)
#ASSERT `the individual hours stage A asks, as amended on 24.2.2008` 0.8 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 2 2008) EQUALS JUST (`stage A individual hours of` 3 FALSE)
#ASSERT `the individual hours stage A asks, as amended on 24.2.2008` 0.8 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2009) EQUALS JUST (`stage A individual hours of` 6 FALSE)
-- At 90% and more, (א)'s weekly hours; the lower rows are the old table's.
#ASSERT `the individual hours stage A asks, as amended on 24.2.2008` 0.9 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2009) EQUALS JUST (`stage A individual hours of` 2 TRUE)
#ASSERT `the individual hours stage A asks, as amended on 24.2.2008` 0.6 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2008) EQUALS `the individual hours stage A asks, as signed on 10.1.2008` 0.6 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2008)
#ASSERT `the individual hours stage A asks, as amended on 24.2.2008` 0.3 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2009) EQUALS `the individual hours stage A asks, as signed on 10.1.2008` 0.3 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2009)
#ASSERT `the individual hours stage A asks, as amended on 24.2.2008` 0.2 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2008) EQUALS NOTHING
